    - rid: 2633833431612260446
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Yeah, it's pretty neat, huh?
    - rid: 2633833431612260447
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: This is Adamine speaking, by the way. It's kind of hard to
          tell with the white boxes being placeholders for our art.
    - rid: 2633833431612260449
      type: {class: DialogueSwapSpeaker, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Swap to Mariena
        swapTo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ca2c48a948cc6744a316cf8f6f1389b, type: 2}
        interactionNum: 0
        textNum: 3
    - rid: 2633833431612260450
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Alright, true. I'll give him some credit for that.
    - rid: 2633833431612260451
      type: {class: DialogueOptions, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: How did you handle the text?
        choices:
        - dialogueLine: I handled it pretty well.
          charcterResponding: {fileID: 11400000}
          interactionNum: 1
          textNum: 0
        - dialogueLine: I did not handle it well.
          charcterResponding: {fileID: 11400000}
          interactionNum: 2
          textNum: 0
    - rid: 2633833431612260452
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Speaking of which, I wonder how long I can speak for. Do you
          think all this text will run off the screen? Let's see how the programmer
          can handle all this text.
    - rid: 2633833431612260454
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Huh, not bad.
    - rid: 2633833431612260455
      type: {class: DialogueNode, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Looks like you still got more work to do then, huh?
    - rid: 2633833431612260456
      type: {class: DialogueSwapSpeaker, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
      data:
        dialogueLine: Swap to Mariena
        swapTo: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3ca2c48a948cc6744a316cf8f6f1389b, type: 2}
        interactionNum: 1
        textNum: 0
    - rid: 2633833431612260457
      type: {class: DialogueSwapSpeaker, ns: , asm: Assembly-CSharp}
